{"meta":{"id":"tt0092099","type":"movie","name":"Top Gun: Pasión y gloria","imdb_id":"tt0092099","description":"La Marina de los Estados Unidos ha creado una escuela de élite para pilotos con el fin de sacar una promoción de expertos en técnicas de combate. En la academia, más conocida como Top Gun, a los mejores se les entrena para ser intrépidos y fríos al mismo tiempo, capaces de no perder los nervios en situaciones extremas y de no inmutarse al romper la barrera del sonido a los mandos de un F-14. A la escuela llega el joven Maverick, famoso por su temeraria aunque brillante forma de pilotar.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0092099.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dBgxEkWe17R0AJDAvAhpeVELQx2.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wfZCqteye4nQttmHszgxkqAMSTw.png","genres":["Acción","Drama","Romance"],"releaseInfo":"1986","released":"1986-05-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"110 min","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"United States of America","cast":["Tom Cruise","Kelly McGillis","Val Kilmer","Anthony Edwards","Tom Skerritt","Michael Ironside","John Stockwell","Barry Tubb","Rick Rossovich","Tim Robbins","Clarence Gilyard Jr.","Whip Hubley","James Tolkan","Meg Ryan","Adrian Pasdar","Randall Brady","Duke Stroud","Brian Sheehan","Ron Clark","Frank Pesce","Pete Pettigrew","Troy Hunter","Linda Rae Jurgens","T.J. Cassidy"],"director":["Tony Scott"],"writer":["Jim Cash","Jack Epps Jr.","Ehud Yonay"],"trailers":[{"source":"Klc__shdj88","type":"Trailer","name":"40th Anniversary Trailer","ytId":"Klc__shdj88","lang":"en"},{"source":"ArOMXELHiLw","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"ArOMXELHiLw","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"Klc__shdj88","title":"40th Anniversary Trailer"},{"ytId":"ArOMXELHiLw","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"7.0","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0092099"},{"name":"Acción","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:/